          "description": "LibriVox v1 (read by Lee Ann Howlett.) Sickly and sheltered, nine-year-old Elizabeth Ann is horrified to hear she must be sent away to live with the \"Putney cousins.\" According to Aunt Harriet, these mysterious relations are cold-hearted, stiff-necked, as well as heavy-handed when it comes to the delegation of children's chores. But what will life at the Putney farm truly have in store for Betsy?",
